#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. Solve the 27-qubit version of the problem. {#4-solve-the-27-qubit-"
"version-of-the-problem}"
msgstr ""
"4. Selesaikan versi 27-Qubit dari masalah ini. {#4-solve-the-27-qubit-"
"version-of-the-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We now demonstrate a smaller-scale version of the utility experiment. We "
"build a 27-qubit $\\times$ 6-layer (2 Trotter steps) circuit with $\\langle "
"Z_{13} \\rangle$ as an observable, and run it both on AerSimulator and a "
"fake device.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang mendemonstrasikan versi skala lebih kecil dari eksperimen "
"utilitas. Kita membangun sirkuit 27-Qubit $\\times$ 6-lapisan (2 langkah "
"Trotter) dengan $\\langle Z_{13} \\rangle$ sebagai observable, dan "
"menjalankannya baik pada AerSimulator maupun perangkat palsu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Of course, we follow our four-step workflow, \"Qiskit pattern\", which consists of Map, Optimize, Execute, and Post-Process. More concretely,\n"
"- Map classical inputs to a quantum computation.\n"
"- Optimize circuits for quantum computation.\n"
"- Execute circuits using primitives.\n"
"- Post-process and return results in classical format.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tentu saja, kita mengikuti alur kerja empat langkah kita, \"pola Qiskit\", yang terdiri dari Map, Optimize, Execute, dan Post-Process. Lebih konkretnya:\n"
"- Petakan input klasik ke komputasi kuantum.\n"
"- Optimalkan sirkuit untuk komputasi kuantum.\n"
"- Jalankan sirkuit menggunakan primitives.\n"
"- Post-process dan kembalikan hasil dalam format klasik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the following, we have the Map step for creating a circuit for a smaller-"
"scale experiment. We then have one set of Optimize and Execute for "
"AerSimulator and another for a fake device.  Finally, we have the Post-"
"Process step to plot the results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Berikut ini, kita memiliki langkah Map untuk membuat sirkuit eksperimen "
"skala lebih kecil. Kemudian kita memiliki satu set Optimize dan Execute "
"untuk AerSimulator dan satu lagi untuk perangkat palsu. Terakhir, kita "
"memiliki langkah Post-Process untuk memplot hasilnya.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "4.1 Step 1: Map {#41-step-1-map}"
msgstr "4.1 Langkah 1: Map {#41-step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4.2 Steps 2 and 3: Optimize and Execute (Simulator) "
"{#42-steps-2-and-3-optimize-and-execute-simulator}"
msgstr ""
"4.2 Langkah 2 dan 3: Optimize dan Execute (Simulator) "
"{#42-steps-2-and-3-optimize-and-execute-simulator}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"One user ran the next cell using a MacBook Pro with 2.3 GHz quad-core Intel "
"Core i7 Processor equipped with 32GB 3LPDDR4X RAM, which is running macOS "
"14.5.  It took 161ms in wall time. Each laptop will be slightly different.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seorang pengguna menjalankan sel berikutnya menggunakan MacBook Pro dengan "
"Prosesor Intel Core i7 quad-core 2.3 GHz yang dilengkapi dengan RAM 32GB "
"3LPDDR4X, yang menjalankan macOS 14.5. Ini memakan waktu 161ms dalam wall "
"time. Setiap laptop akan sedikit berbeda.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4.3 Steps 2 and 3: Optimize and execute (fake device) "
"{#43-steps-2-and-3-optimize-and-execute-fake-device}"
msgstr ""
"4.3 Langkah 2 dan 3: Optimize dan execute (perangkat palsu) "
"{#43-steps-2-and-3-optimize-and-execute-fake-device}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When the same user ran the next cell with the same environment as above, it "
"took 2min 19s in Wall Time.  Executing a circuit on a fake device invokes "
"noisy simulation which takes much longer time than exact simulation.   We "
"recommend you not execute a larger circuit (such as a 27-qubit $\\times$ 9 "
"layers with 3 Trotter steps) on a fake device.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ketika pengguna yang sama menjalankan sel berikutnya dengan lingkungan yang "
"sama seperti di atas, dibutuhkan 2 menit 19 detik dalam Wall Time. "
"Menjalankan sirkuit pada perangkat palsu memerlukan simulasi bergangguan "
"yang membutuhkan waktu jauh lebih lama daripada simulasi eksak. Kami "
"menyarankan kamu untuk tidak menjalankan sirkuit yang lebih besar (seperti "
"27-Qubit $\\times$ 9 lapisan dengan 3 langkah Trotter) pada perangkat "
"palsu.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "4.4 Step 4: Post-process {#44-step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "4.4 Langkah 4: Post-process {#44-step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We plot the results from exact and noisy simulations. You see the severe "
"effects of noise on FakeToronto.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita memplot hasil dari simulasi eksak dan bergangguan. Kamu melihat efek "
"gangguan yang parah pada FakeToronto.\n"

